  "description": "She fell into a sinkhole that suddenly appeared on her way home from work and became possessed by the character in her favorite horror game, The Devil's House. And to top it all off, she was the very first victim of a psychopathic serial killer! \n\n *“You’re quick-witted, aren’t you? I was planning to get rid of you right away if you made any noise.”* \n\nSilas said this with a bright smile on his handsome face. However, the meaning behind those words was so chilling that it sent shivers down her spine. How could she survive? She tried to think it over with her hair turned white, but having not yet seen the ending, she had no idea. Then... \n\n *“H-Honey! Don’t you remember me?”* \n\nTo survive against the amnesiac psychopath, she decided to pretend to be his wife.",
